  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to icddr,b Bangladesh, Centrum for Diarrhoeal Research based in Dhaka. It is a continuation of earlier support.     Duration is 2012-2014 with total 30 MSEK/distr annually with 10 MSEK. The responsibility for the contr lies at Emb/Dhaka in overall coop    with PARTNER/FORSK who is resp for addit research support via Regional Asia/resp Sida HQ, 6 million SEK/year 2012-2015, MSEK 24</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insitutionsst&#xF6;d till icddr,b, Centrum f&#xF6;r Dirrhoeal Disease Research  i Bangladesh 2012-2014 m 30 MSEK, f&#xF6;rdelat p&#xE5; 10 MSEK &#xE5;rligen. St&#xF6;det &#xE4;r en forts&#xE4;ttning p&#xE5; tidigare st&#xF6;d. Ansvar f&#xF6;r st&#xF6;det ligger p&#xE5;      amb/Dhaka med &#xF6;vergrip ansvar i samarbete PARTNER/FORSK d&#xE4;r det finns ett forskningsst&#xF6;d p&#xE5; 6 MSEK/&#xE5;r 2012-2016 fr&#xE5;n regionala Asien,       delegerat till PARTNER/FORSK.</narrative>
